The MHRM information matrix isn't always the most stable, try dropping the SEtol default like so to make it run longer and stabilize:

mod <- mirt(Science, 1, SE=TRUE, method = 'MHRM', technical = list(SEtol = 1e-4))
fscores(mod, MI=30)

Phil

